{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相伴觀眾近 10 年的長壽處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》近日迎來結局週！在昨晚（3 日）播出的戲份中，金城安（周嘉洛飾）與 Bonnie（林凱恩飾）上演了一幕極之虐心的碼頭吻別戲，瞬間引爆全城熱話。這對陪伴無數觀眾成長的螢幕情侶最終迎來「安Bon戀」的徹底結束，令大批忠實粉絲大感心痛，紛紛在社交平台上洗版留言，直呼這簡直是「全城失戀日」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ba42ba0b-4c31-4783-a994-663b38afc453.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026mK3Iv5CrXL1785833284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ba42ba0b-4c31-4783-a994-663b38afc453.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為了與大家一同回味這段珍貴的青春記憶，劇迷與網民紛紛翻出「安Bon」過去 9 年來的各種甜蜜點滴——從早期青澀笨拙的告白、爆笑連場的約會，到無數次高調放閃與深情對望，每一個畫面都承載著滿滿的回憶。不少觀眾感嘆，這對CP見證了許多人的青春，如今迎來結局，縱然不捨，但也只能將這段美好回憶永遠留在心中。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a3614050-1551-44f0-ace8-5d0eb40d8e7e.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026fnY3Bs7euE1785833284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a3614050-1551-44f0-ace8-5d0eb40d8e7e.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"456456ba-8e1d-4901-aa9d-60de9527c8c0.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xPrDjAsib61785833284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"456456ba-8e1d-4901-aa9d-60de9527c8c0.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"13a6648e-34d4-4da7-9dc1-4328fdae3d92.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026iXPfoBWa2K1785833284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"13a6648e-34d4-4da7-9dc1-4328fdae3d92.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f833e4b2-efcc-4930-93ad-a366386aad55.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026XZYgOQljqW1785833284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f833e4b2-efcc-4930-93ad-a366386aad55.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e2f168e1-1822-4d0a-b230-75bfe4452525.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026I97JKTcLRf1785833285.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e2f168e1-1822-4d0a-b230-75bfe4452525.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T12:19:58.002609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}